    "text": "Notice under Section 7 ReferenceNo.: NE/3/1/8/Acquisition/162 I hereby give notice under Sub - section (1) of the Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intended to acquired. Description of the land to be acquired:",
