    "text": "Allotment of land called in Total Extent about 0.1389 Hectare described as Lot 01 in Preliminary Plan No. P.P.Nu 3147 of 01.08.2017 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in Scrb Estae in West NuwaraEliya Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division in Oya Palatha Korale Minor Division in Nuwara Eliya Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, in Nuwara - Eliya District in Central Province and bounded as follows: 01. Lot No. 01",
