      347.12,
      539.86,
      470.96
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat on the 04th July, 2018 at 11.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd day of June, 2018. The nature of their interests in the land. The particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
